  "id": "TN-SB-352-2011",
  "scope": "state:tn",
  "title": "SB 352 (107th General Assembly): As enacted, requires the coordinator of elections to compare the statewide voter registration database with the department of safety database to ensure non-United States citizens are not registered to vote in this state. - Amends TCA Title 2, Chapter 2, Part 1.",
  "urls": [
    "https://legiscan.com/TN/bill/SB0352/2011",
    "https://legiscan.com/TN/rollcall/SB0352/id/77597",
    "https://legiscan.com/TN/rollcall/SB0352/id/78942",
    "https://legiscan.com/TN/rollcall/SB0352/id/80088",
